WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Izitshalo nezilwane ziyashintsha kancane kancane lapho indawo iphazamisekile.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Izitshalo zokuqala zikhula ngokushesha, zimboze umhlabathi ongenalutho.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Lapho zifa, amaqabunga neziqu zazo zondla umhlabathi.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Kulandela utshani, amakhambi nezihlahlana ezihlala isikhathi eside.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Lapha e-Highveld, indawo yotshani ephilile ingahlala isikhathi eside.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Vumela indawo eyindle epulazini lakho ikhule ngendlela efanele leyo ndawo.
